table keyboard1 0x34a 4280 256 ; Keyboard Part 1
field sample ~0 u16be @0:15 0 999 ; Sample-Nr.
field sample_off ~0 u16be @15:1 0=Aktiv 1=OFF ; Sample OFF
field slice ~2 u8 0 255 ; Slice No. (MSB=ALL)
field glide ~4 u8 0 127 ; Glide
field filtertype ~5 u8 0=LPF 1=HPF 2=BPF 3=BPF+ ; Filter Type
field cutoff ~6 u8 0 127 ; Cutoff
field reso ~7 u8 0 127 ; Resonance
field egint ~8 u8 0 127 ; EG Int (64=0)
field level ~9 u8 0 127 ; Level
field pan ~10 u8 0 127 ; Pan (64=Center)
field egtime ~11 u8 0 127 ; EG Time
field start ~12 u8 0 127 ; Start Point
field fxselect ~13 u8 @0:2 0 2 ; FX Select (0=FX1..2=FX3)
field fxsend ~13 u8 @2:1 0=Off 1=On ; FX Send
field roll ~13 u8 @3:1 0=Off 1=On ; Roll
field ampeg ~13 u8 @4:1 0=Gate 1=EG ; Amp EG
field reverse ~13 u8 @5:1 0=Off 1=On ; Reverse
field moddest ~14 u8 @0:3 0=Pitch 1=Cutoff 2=Amp 3=Pan ; Mod Dest
field modtype ~14 u8 @4:3 0=Saw 1=Squ 2=Tri 3=S&H 4=EG ; Mod Type
field bpmsync ~14 u8 @7:1 0=Off 1=On ; BPM Sync
field modspeed ~15 u8 0 127 ; Mod Speed
field moddepth ~16 u8 0 127 ; Mod Depth (64=0)
field motionseq ~17 u8 0=Off 1=Smooth 2=TrigHold ; Motion Seq
arr notes ~18 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step (0-127, MSB/128+ = Off)
arr gates ~146 128 0 255 ; Gate-Zeit pro Step (T7-1)

